      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7906602",
      "subQuestName": "Undergo the trial with Princess Cimest",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790660201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790660201": {
            "id": "790660201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So... This is where the relic was being kept?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660204"
            ]
          },
          "790660204": {
            "id": "790660204",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "Perhaps in driving the dragon away, we also drove it into a rage.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660205"
            ]
          },
          "790660205": {
            "id": "790660205",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "The relic is down there. Pass the trial, and you may claim it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660206"
            ]
          },
          "790660206": {
            "id": "790660206",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon thought that the relic would be protected by some kind of seal, or guard, or... something.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660207"
            ]
          },
          "790660207": {
            "id": "790660207",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But it looks like it's just lying there, and it doesn't seem like anything's stopping someone from just taking it..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7906603",
      "subQuestName": "Undergo the trial with Princess Cimest",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790660301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790660301": {
            "id": "790660301",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#We passed! {NICKNAME}, we're Guardians now! So is this the relic that's used to acknowledge new Guardians?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660302"
            ]
          },
          "790660302": {
            "id": "790660302",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? There's something carved onto it, like a line of text maybe? Let Paimon take a closer look...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660303"
            ]
          },
          "790660303": {
            "id": "790660303",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Stories follow rules, unfolding in cyclical patterns, but each should follow its own course.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660304"
            ]
          },
          "790660304": {
            "id": "790660304",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Uhh, Paimon doesn't get it. Do you get it, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660307"
            ]
          },
          "790660307": {
            "id": "790660307",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "Those words have always been there. Even I do not know their origin...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660308"
            ]
          },
          "790660308": {
            "id": "790660308",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "I sense that they may hold some great significance for the kingdom... But I have yet to grasp their meaning.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660309"
            ]
          },
          "790660309": {
            "id": "790660309",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "Whatever the case, given your performance in the trial, you are undoubtedly the most suitable candidate for the title of \"Guardian\" that I've ever met.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660310"
            ]
          },
          "790660310": {
            "id": "790660310",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "Your abilities and judgment are beyond question. Meeting you at a time like this is truly a blessing for our kingdom.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660311"
            ]
          },
          "790660311": {
            "id": "790660311",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "Now that we have retrieved the relic, we may hold the ceremony right away.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660312"
            ]
          },
          "790660312": {
            "id": "790660312",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "I am fully confident that your courage and abilities will have won you the relic's respect."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7906608",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Princess Cimest",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790660701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790660701": {
            "id": "790660701",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "...I didn't expect you to be able to judge the wind currents so accurately.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660702"
            ]
          },
          "790660702": {
            "id": "790660702",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "If you were flying squirrels like I am, navigating those wind currents would pose you no challenge, of that I am certain...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660705"
            ]
          },
          "790660705": {
            "id": "790660705",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "Pfff... Is that so? I'm glad to hear that, because you two are the most Guardian-like candidates I've ever seen.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660706"
            ]
          },
          "790660706": {
            "id": "790660706",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "Then let us continue. The current wind conditions are just right.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660707"
            ]
          },
          "790660707": {
            "id": "790660707",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "No problem!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660708"
            ]
          },
          "790660708": {
            "id": "790660708",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe, everything's going great! Maybe we're the Guardians that Her Highness has been looking for."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7906609",
      "subQuestName": "Undergo the trial with Princess Cimest",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790660901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790660901": {
            "id": "790660901",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So... This is where the relic was being kept?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660904"
            ]
          },
          "790660904": {
            "id": "790660904",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "Perhaps in driving the dragon away, we also drove it into a rage.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660905"
            ]
          },
          "790660905": {
            "id": "790660905",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That dragon is actually...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660906"
            ]
          },
          "790660906": {
            "id": "790660906",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You tell the story of the dragon to Princess Cimest in its entirety, sparing no detail...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660907"
            ]
          },
          "790660907": {
            "id": "790660907",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "...Can such a thing be? Truly unexpected.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660908"
            ]
          },
          "790660908": {
            "id": "790660908",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "At the time, I was too panicked, and so I just gave the order to drive him away.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660909"
            ]
          },
          "790660909": {
            "id": "790660909",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "Had we the chance to calmly speak with one another, perhaps...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660910"
            ]
          },
          "790660910": {
            "id": "790660910",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "Ahem! Never mind. What's done is done. We must focus on the problem at hand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660911"
            ]
          },
          "790660911": {
            "id": "790660911",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "As for that dragon... once all our problems have been resolved, I shall visit him personally.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660912"
            ]
          },
          "790660912": {
            "id": "790660912",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "Now, let us focus on the relic.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660913"
            ]
          },
          "790660913": {
            "id": "790660913",
            "speakerId": 21470,
            "speakerName": "Cimest",
            "text": "The relic is down there. Pass the trial, and you may claim it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660914"
            ]
          },
          "790660914": {
            "id": "790660914",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon thought that the relic would be protected by some kind of seal, or guard, or... something.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790660915"
            ]
          },
          "790660915": {
            "id": "790660915",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But it looks like it's just lying there, and it doesn't seem like anything's stopping someone from just taking it..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
